[
  {
    "start": "00:00:00.000",
    "end": "00:00:03.390",
    "start_seconds": 0.0,
    "end_seconds": 3.39,
    "text": "Please give a warm welcome to Matthew Dix."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:05.820",
    "end": "00:00:09.210",
    "start_seconds": 5.82,
    "end_seconds": 9.21,
    "text": "It's 1991 and I'm 20 years old and"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:09.210",
    "end": "00:00:11.250",
    "start_seconds": 9.21,
    "end_seconds": 11.25,
    "text": "I'm driving home from the very first"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:11.250",
    "end": "00:00:14.250",
    "start_seconds": 11.25,
    "end_seconds": 14.25,
    "text": "booty qual of my entire life, and"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:14.310",
    "end": "00:00:16.470",
    "start_seconds": 14.31,
    "end_seconds": 16.47,
    "text": "I am excited because I don't know."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:17.410",
    "end": "00:00:19.600",
    "start_seconds": 17.41,
    "end_seconds": 19.6,
    "text": "That this is going to also be the very"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:19.600",
    "end": "00:00:22.240",
    "start_seconds": 19.6,
    "end_seconds": 22.24,
    "text": "last booty call of my entire life."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:23.110",
    "end": "00:00:25.060",
    "start_seconds": 23.11,
    "end_seconds": 25.06,
    "text": "And then it's in that moment of excitement"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:25.240",
    "end": "00:00:28.480",
    "start_seconds": 25.24,
    "end_seconds": 28.48,
    "text": "that the right front tire of my 1976 Chevy"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:28.480",
    "end": "00:00:30.880",
    "start_seconds": 28.48,
    "end_seconds": 30.88,
    "text": "Malibu blows out, but it doesn't deflate."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:30.880",
    "end": "00:00:32.080",
    "start_seconds": 30.88,
    "end_seconds": 32.08,
    "text": "It disintegrates."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:32.200",
    "end": "00:00:34.300",
    "start_seconds": 32.2,
    "end_seconds": 34.3,
    "text": "It throws rubber rubber on the road in"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:34.300",
    "end": "00:00:36.160",
    "start_seconds": 34.3,
    "end_seconds": 36.16,
    "text": "a way that I didn't think was possible,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:36.340",
    "end": "00:00:38.680",
    "start_seconds": 36.34,
    "end_seconds": 38.68,
    "text": "and it takes everything I can to get the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:38.860",
    "end": "00:00:41.500",
    "start_seconds": 38.86,
    "end_seconds": 41.5,
    "text": "car over to the shoulder and to a stop."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:41.740",
    "end": "00:00:43.240",
    "start_seconds": 41.74,
    "end_seconds": 43.24,
    "text": "And it's 1991."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:43.605",
    "end": "00:00:44.805",
    "start_seconds": 43.605,
    "end_seconds": 44.805,
    "text": "I don't have a cell phone,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:45.105",
    "end": "00:00:46.335",
    "start_seconds": 45.105,
    "end_seconds": 46.335,
    "text": "so I do the only thing I can."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:46.335",
    "end": "00:00:47.715",
    "start_seconds": 46.335,
    "end_seconds": 47.715,
    "text": "I start hiking up the road to look"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:47.715",
    "end": "00:00:51.165",
    "start_seconds": 47.715,
    "end_seconds": 51.165,
    "text": "for help seven hours later after"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:51.165",
    "end": "00:00:52.995",
    "start_seconds": 51.165,
    "end_seconds": 52.995,
    "text": "giving all of my money to a half"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:52.995",
    "end": "00:00:54.735",
    "start_seconds": 52.995,
    "end_seconds": 54.735,
    "text": "naked mountain man named Winston."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:55.125",
    "end": "00:00:56.895",
    "start_seconds": 55.125,
    "end_seconds": 56.895,
    "text": "I have a bald tire on my"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:56.895",
    "end": "00:00:58.395",
    "start_seconds": 56.895,
    "end_seconds": 58.395,
    "text": "car and I'm heading home."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:58.665",
    "end": "00:00:59.775",
    "start_seconds": 58.665,
    "end_seconds": 59.775,
    "text": "When I look at the instrument"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:59.775",
    "end": "00:01:02.055",
    "start_seconds": 59.775,
    "end_seconds": 62.055,
    "text": "panel and I see that I have no gas"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:02.445",
    "end": "00:01:04.010",
    "start_seconds": 62.445,
    "end_seconds": 64.01,
    "text": "and all of the money that I have."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:04.474",
    "end": "00:01:07.655",
    "start_seconds": 64.474,
    "end_seconds": 67.655,
    "text": "Is in Winston's hand, and it's 1991."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:07.655",
    "end": "00:01:08.854",
    "start_seconds": 67.655,
    "end_seconds": 68.854,
    "text": "I don't have a credit card."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:08.884",
    "end": "00:01:10.205",
    "start_seconds": 68.884,
    "end_seconds": 70.205,
    "text": "I don't have an ATM card."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:10.445",
    "end": "00:01:12.455",
    "start_seconds": 70.445,
    "end_seconds": 72.455,
    "text": "I don't even have a checking account."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:13.264",
    "end": "00:01:15.335",
    "start_seconds": 73.264,
    "end_seconds": 75.33500000000001,
    "text": "And so I take the next exit and I roll"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:15.335",
    "end": "00:01:17.945",
    "start_seconds": 75.33500000000001,
    "end_seconds": 77.945,
    "text": "my car into a Getty station, and as I"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:17.945",
    "end": "00:01:21.035",
    "start_seconds": 77.945,
    "end_seconds": 81.035,
    "text": "park the car, I'm angry and I'm sad."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:21.604",
    "end": "00:01:22.955",
    "start_seconds": 81.604,
    "end_seconds": 82.955,
    "text": "I'm 20 years old."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:23.345",
    "end": "00:01:24.845",
    "start_seconds": 83.345,
    "end_seconds": 84.845,
    "text": "I'm a McDonald's manager."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:25.205",
    "end": "00:01:27.755",
    "start_seconds": 85.205,
    "end_seconds": 87.755,
    "text": "I make $7 and 25 cents an hour,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:27.994",
    "end": "00:01:29.945",
    "start_seconds": 87.994,
    "end_seconds": 89.945,
    "text": "and I'm the richest person I know."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:30.785",
    "end": "00:01:31.955",
    "start_seconds": 90.785,
    "end_seconds": 91.955,
    "text": "My mother is living on"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:31.955",
    "end": "00:01:32.880",
    "start_seconds": 91.955,
    "end_seconds": 92.88,
    "text": "welfare with my sister."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:33.840",
    "end": "00:01:36.000",
    "start_seconds": 93.84,
    "end_seconds": 96.0,
    "text": "My father's left 10 years ago, and"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:36.000",
    "end": "00:01:37.979",
    "start_seconds": 96.0,
    "end_seconds": 97.979,
    "text": "the only friend that I have who even"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:37.979",
    "end": "00:01:40.289",
    "start_seconds": 97.979,
    "end_seconds": 100.289,
    "text": "has a credit card or a car that can"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:40.289",
    "end": "00:01:42.000",
    "start_seconds": 100.289,
    "end_seconds": 102.0,
    "text": "make this a hundred mile trip to New"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:42.000",
    "end": "00:01:44.370",
    "start_seconds": 102.0,
    "end_seconds": 104.37,
    "text": "Hampshire is off on some college weekend,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:44.370",
    "end": "00:01:45.690",
    "start_seconds": 104.37,
    "end_seconds": 105.69,
    "text": "and I can't get in touch with him."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:46.050",
    "end": "00:01:48.270",
    "start_seconds": 106.05,
    "end_seconds": 108.27000000000001,
    "text": "And this was not the plan for my life."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:48.270",
    "end": "00:01:50.370",
    "start_seconds": 108.27000000000001,
    "end_seconds": 110.37,
    "text": "I was not supposed to be this alone."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:51.164",
    "end": "00:01:52.274",
    "start_seconds": 111.164,
    "end_seconds": 112.274,
    "text": "And so I go into the Getty"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:52.274",
    "end": "00:01:54.074",
    "start_seconds": 112.274,
    "end_seconds": 114.074,
    "text": "Station to beg for gas."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:54.434",
    "end": "00:01:56.925",
    "start_seconds": 114.434,
    "end_seconds": 116.925,
    "text": "$8 worth of gas is all I need 'cause"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:56.925",
    "end": "00:02:00.734",
    "start_seconds": 116.925,
    "end_seconds": 120.734,
    "text": "it's 1991 and gas is 85 cents a gallon."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:01.514",
    "end": "00:02:03.164",
    "start_seconds": 121.514,
    "end_seconds": 123.164,
    "text": "And the kid behind the counter"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:03.225",
    "end": "00:02:04.335",
    "start_seconds": 123.225,
    "end_seconds": 124.335,
    "text": "will not give it to me."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:04.725",
    "end": "00:02:06.225",
    "start_seconds": 124.725,
    "end_seconds": 126.225,
    "text": "He doesn't wanna lose his job and"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:06.225",
    "end": "00:02:08.324",
    "start_seconds": 126.225,
    "end_seconds": 128.324,
    "text": "I offer everything and he says no."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:08.685",
    "end": "00:02:10.185",
    "start_seconds": 128.685,
    "end_seconds": 130.185,
    "text": "So I go back to my car and my plan"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:10.185",
    "end": "00:02:11.894",
    "start_seconds": 130.185,
    "end_seconds": 131.894,
    "text": "is to wait for the next shift change."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:12.135",
    "end": "00:02:13.635",
    "start_seconds": 132.135,
    "end_seconds": 133.635,
    "text": "Maybe someone more sympathetic will"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:13.635",
    "end": "00:02:15.915",
    "start_seconds": 133.635,
    "end_seconds": 135.915,
    "text": "take over, but as I climb into my car,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:15.915",
    "end": "00:02:17.924",
    "start_seconds": 135.915,
    "end_seconds": 137.924,
    "text": "I see my McDonald's uniform crumpled"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:17.924",
    "end": "00:02:19.875",
    "start_seconds": 137.924,
    "end_seconds": 139.875,
    "text": "in the back, and I have an idea."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:20.695",
    "end": "00:02:22.075",
    "start_seconds": 140.695,
    "end_seconds": 142.075,
    "text": "An hour later, I'm in a"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:22.075",
    "end": "00:02:23.365",
    "start_seconds": 142.075,
    "end_seconds": 143.365,
    "text": "residential neighborhood about"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:23.365",
    "end": "00:02:24.775",
    "start_seconds": 143.365,
    "end_seconds": 144.775,
    "text": "a mile from the Getty Station."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:25.165",
    "end": "00:02:26.965",
    "start_seconds": 145.165,
    "end_seconds": 146.965,
    "text": "I'm on the porch of a red brick"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:26.965",
    "end": "00:02:29.095",
    "start_seconds": 146.965,
    "end_seconds": 149.095,
    "text": "house, and I'm knocking on the door."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:29.335",
    "end": "00:02:31.075",
    "start_seconds": 149.335,
    "end_seconds": 151.075,
    "text": "I'm wearing my McDonald's uniform,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:31.075",
    "end": "00:02:32.485",
    "start_seconds": 151.075,
    "end_seconds": 152.485,
    "text": "the blue shirt, the blue pants,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:32.485",
    "end": "00:02:35.485",
    "start_seconds": 152.485,
    "end_seconds": 155.485,
    "text": "the blue tie, the door opens, and"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:35.485",
    "end": "00:02:36.985",
    "start_seconds": 155.485,
    "end_seconds": 156.985,
    "text": "there's a man standing in front of me."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:36.985",
    "end": "00:02:39.085",
    "start_seconds": 156.985,
    "end_seconds": 159.085,
    "text": "And I know at that moment that this"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:39.115",
    "end": "00:02:42.535",
    "start_seconds": 159.115,
    "end_seconds": 162.535,
    "text": "is a bad idea, but it's three o'clock"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:42.535",
    "end": "00:02:44.635",
    "start_seconds": 162.535,
    "end_seconds": 164.635,
    "text": "on a Sunday afternoon, and I'm on his"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:44.635",
    "end": "00:02:46.915",
    "start_seconds": 164.635,
    "end_seconds": 166.915,
    "text": "porch in a McDonald's uniform, and the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:46.915",
    "end": "00:02:49.105",
    "start_seconds": 166.915,
    "end_seconds": 169.105,
    "text": "only way to get off is to go forward."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:49.505",
    "end": "00:02:52.715",
    "start_seconds": 169.505,
    "end_seconds": 172.715,
    "text": "So I say to him, my name is Matt."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:53.135",
    "end": "00:02:54.860",
    "start_seconds": 173.135,
    "end_seconds": 174.86,
    "text": "I'm collecting money for the Ronald"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:54.860",
    "end": "00:02:56.645",
    "start_seconds": 174.86,
    "end_seconds": 176.645,
    "text": "McDonald Children's Charities."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:57.485",
    "end": "00:02:59.465",
    "start_seconds": 177.485,
    "end_seconds": 179.465,
    "text": "Can you please make a donation?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:00.215",
    "end": "00:03:02.075",
    "start_seconds": 180.215,
    "end_seconds": 182.075,
    "text": "And this man stares at me like"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:02.075",
    "end": "00:03:04.415",
    "start_seconds": 182.075,
    "end_seconds": 184.415,
    "text": "Stone Hen she does not move."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:04.475",
    "end": "00:03:07.115",
    "start_seconds": 184.475,
    "end_seconds": 187.115,
    "text": "He's 50, but he might as well be 500."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:07.115",
    "end": "00:03:09.185",
    "start_seconds": 187.115,
    "end_seconds": 189.185,
    "text": "He is all of the wisdom and knowledge"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:09.185",
    "end": "00:03:11.075",
    "start_seconds": 189.185,
    "end_seconds": 191.075,
    "text": "of the world wrapped into one man."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:11.075",
    "end": "00:03:12.785",
    "start_seconds": 191.075,
    "end_seconds": 192.785,
    "text": "And I know he knows I'm lying."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:13.055",
    "end": "00:03:14.345",
    "start_seconds": 193.055,
    "end_seconds": 194.345,
    "text": "And the next words that come out"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:14.345",
    "end": "00:03:17.195",
    "start_seconds": 194.345,
    "end_seconds": 197.195,
    "text": "of my mouth, I don't expect, I say."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:17.435",
    "end": "00:03:20.075",
    "start_seconds": 197.435,
    "end_seconds": 200.075,
    "text": "My mom died of cancer when I was young,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:21.395",
    "end": "00:03:24.155",
    "start_seconds": 201.395,
    "end_seconds": 204.155,
    "text": "and my sister has cancer now, and I'm"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:24.155",
    "end": "00:03:27.425",
    "start_seconds": 204.155,
    "end_seconds": 207.425,
    "text": "just trying to do what I can to help."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:27.455",
    "end": "00:03:29.345",
    "start_seconds": 207.45499999999998,
    "end_seconds": 209.345,
    "text": "And he looks at me and points"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:29.345",
    "end": "00:03:31.355",
    "start_seconds": 209.345,
    "end_seconds": 211.355,
    "text": "and says, you stay right there."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:31.625",
    "end": "00:03:33.485",
    "start_seconds": 211.625,
    "end_seconds": 213.485,
    "text": "And he goes back into the house and closes"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:33.485",
    "end": "00:03:35.915",
    "start_seconds": 213.485,
    "end_seconds": 215.915,
    "text": "the door, and I know that he's calling"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:35.915",
    "end": "00:03:38.195",
    "start_seconds": 215.915,
    "end_seconds": 218.195,
    "text": "the police, and I'm going to get arrested"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:38.195",
    "end": "00:03:39.695",
    "start_seconds": 218.195,
    "end_seconds": 219.695,
    "text": "for stealing money from McDonald's,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:39.695",
    "end": "00:03:41.315",
    "start_seconds": 219.695,
    "end_seconds": 221.315,
    "text": "which ironically, two years later"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:41.315",
    "end": "00:03:45.575",
    "start_seconds": 221.315,
    "end_seconds": 225.575,
    "text": "will actually happen, but not on this."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:45.595",
    "end": "00:03:48.805",
    "start_seconds": 225.595,
    "end_seconds": 228.805,
    "text": "Day because he comes back to the door"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:48.955",
    "end": "00:03:51.205",
    "start_seconds": 228.95499999999998,
    "end_seconds": 231.20499999999998,
    "text": "and he has $20 in his hand, which"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:51.205",
    "end": "00:03:53.665",
    "start_seconds": 231.20499999999998,
    "end_seconds": 233.665,
    "text": "is like $20,000 to me on this day."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:53.845",
    "end": "00:03:55.465",
    "start_seconds": 233.845,
    "end_seconds": 235.465,
    "text": "And he presses it into my palm"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:55.465",
    "end": "00:03:57.175",
    "start_seconds": 235.465,
    "end_seconds": 237.175,
    "text": "and I say, no, that's too much."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:57.385",
    "end": "00:03:59.755",
    "start_seconds": 237.385,
    "end_seconds": 239.755,
    "text": "And he says to me, my wife"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:59.755",
    "end": "00:04:01.735",
    "start_seconds": 239.755,
    "end_seconds": 241.735,
    "text": "died of cancer five years ago,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:03.204",
    "end": "00:04:05.605",
    "start_seconds": 243.204,
    "end_seconds": 245.605,
    "text": "and I think this is a really."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:06.214",
    "end": "00:04:07.744",
    "start_seconds": 246.214,
    "end_seconds": 247.744,
    "text": "Bad idea I had."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:08.015",
    "end": "00:04:09.964",
    "start_seconds": 248.015,
    "end_seconds": 249.964,
    "text": "And before I know it, I am sitting"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:09.964",
    "end": "00:04:12.035",
    "start_seconds": 249.964,
    "end_seconds": 252.035,
    "text": "on the porch with this man and he"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:12.035",
    "end": "00:04:13.535",
    "start_seconds": 252.035,
    "end_seconds": 253.535,
    "text": "asks me about, my mother died of,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:13.535",
    "end": "00:04:14.975",
    "start_seconds": 253.535,
    "end_seconds": 254.975,
    "text": "and I say breast cancer, 'cause it's"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:14.975",
    "end": "00:04:16.685",
    "start_seconds": 254.975,
    "end_seconds": 256.685,
    "text": "the first one that pops to my mind."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:16.985",
    "end": "00:04:18.394",
    "start_seconds": 256.985,
    "end_seconds": 258.394,
    "text": "And he says, what does your sister have?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:18.394",
    "end": "00:04:19.445",
    "start_seconds": 258.394,
    "end_seconds": 259.445,
    "text": "And I say, leukemia, which"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:19.445",
    "end": "00:04:20.584",
    "start_seconds": 259.445,
    "end_seconds": 260.584,
    "text": "I don't actually know is a"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:20.584",
    "end": "00:04:22.445",
    "start_seconds": 260.584,
    "end_seconds": 262.445,
    "text": "cancer, but I know kids get it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:22.925",
    "end": "00:04:24.455",
    "start_seconds": 262.925,
    "end_seconds": 264.455,
    "text": "And he tells me that his wife"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:24.455",
    "end": "00:04:25.865",
    "start_seconds": 264.455,
    "end_seconds": 265.865,
    "text": "Lisa, died of lung cancer."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:26.305",
    "end": "00:04:27.775",
    "start_seconds": 266.305,
    "end_seconds": 267.775,
    "text": "And that his kids live on the West"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:27.775",
    "end": "00:04:31.015",
    "start_seconds": 267.775,
    "end_seconds": 271.015,
    "text": "Coast and he tells me how she struggled"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:31.135",
    "end": "00:04:33.655",
    "start_seconds": 271.135,
    "end_seconds": 273.655,
    "text": "for two years and how he wanted to"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:33.655",
    "end": "00:04:35.844",
    "start_seconds": 273.655,
    "end_seconds": 275.844,
    "text": "tell her it was okay to go, but he"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:35.844",
    "end": "00:04:38.635",
    "start_seconds": 275.844,
    "end_seconds": 278.635,
    "text": "couldn't, and how badly he felt that"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:38.635",
    "end": "00:04:40.615",
    "start_seconds": 278.635,
    "end_seconds": 280.615,
    "text": "he watched her struggle for so long."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:41.215",
    "end": "00:04:42.985",
    "start_seconds": 281.21500000000003,
    "end_seconds": 282.985,
    "text": "And I sat on that porch and I"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:42.985",
    "end": "00:04:44.425",
    "start_seconds": 282.985,
    "end_seconds": 284.425,
    "text": "listened to him and I prayed."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:44.425",
    "end": "00:04:45.865",
    "start_seconds": 284.425,
    "end_seconds": 285.865,
    "text": "He wouldn't ask me anything"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:46.225",
    "end": "00:04:47.844",
    "start_seconds": 286.225,
    "end_seconds": 287.844,
    "text": "and I just wanted to get off."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:48.540",
    "end": "00:04:50.130",
    "start_seconds": 288.54,
    "end_seconds": 290.13,
    "text": "And so finally we were hugging and"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:50.130",
    "end": "00:04:52.230",
    "start_seconds": 290.13,
    "end_seconds": 292.23,
    "text": "I was walking down the walk with $20"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:52.230",
    "end": "00:04:54.210",
    "start_seconds": 292.23,
    "end_seconds": 294.21,
    "text": "in my hand and it felt like poison."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:54.990",
    "end": "00:04:57.540",
    "start_seconds": 294.99,
    "end_seconds": 297.54,
    "text": "I got to my car and I sat in there and"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:57.540",
    "end": "00:05:00.360",
    "start_seconds": 297.54,
    "end_seconds": 300.36,
    "text": "I remembered how lonely I felt, and"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:00.360",
    "end": "00:05:03.480",
    "start_seconds": 300.36,
    "end_seconds": 303.48,
    "text": "then I felt so stupid and small and."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:04.460",
    "end": "00:05:05.900",
    "start_seconds": 304.46,
    "end_seconds": 305.9,
    "text": "Because I knew at that moment I"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:05.900",
    "end": "00:05:08.300",
    "start_seconds": 305.9,
    "end_seconds": 308.3,
    "text": "didn't understand real loneliness."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:08.630",
    "end": "00:05:10.970",
    "start_seconds": 308.63,
    "end_seconds": 310.97,
    "text": "I was a 20-year-old kid with friends"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:10.970",
    "end": "00:05:13.430",
    "start_seconds": 310.97,
    "end_seconds": 313.43,
    "text": "and I was stuck in New Hampshire,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:14.180",
    "end": "00:05:15.800",
    "start_seconds": 314.18,
    "end_seconds": 315.8,
    "text": "but I had walked away from a man"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:15.800",
    "end": "00:05:18.020",
    "start_seconds": 315.8,
    "end_seconds": 318.02,
    "text": "who was in a tiny house with a wife"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:18.020",
    "end": "00:05:19.760",
    "start_seconds": 318.02,
    "end_seconds": 319.76,
    "text": "that was gone and the kids that were"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:19.760",
    "end": "00:05:22.100",
    "start_seconds": 319.76,
    "end_seconds": 322.1,
    "text": "gone, and he had a loneliness in"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:22.100",
    "end": "00:05:24.200",
    "start_seconds": 322.1,
    "end_seconds": 324.2,
    "text": "him that I would never understand."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:25.280",
    "end": "00:05:26.510",
    "start_seconds": 325.28,
    "end_seconds": 326.51,
    "text": "And so I put the gas in"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:26.510",
    "end": "00:05:28.310",
    "start_seconds": 326.51,
    "end_seconds": 328.31,
    "text": "my car and I drove home."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:30.080",
    "end": "00:05:33.080",
    "start_seconds": 330.08,
    "end_seconds": 333.08,
    "text": "But he has always been with me."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:34.425",
    "end": "00:05:37.125",
    "start_seconds": 334.425,
    "end_seconds": 337.125,
    "text": "I have never left that man on that porch"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:37.125",
    "end": "00:05:39.705",
    "start_seconds": 337.125,
    "end_seconds": 339.705,
    "text": "that day, and I'm hopeful that I'll"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:39.705",
    "end": "00:05:42.135",
    "start_seconds": 339.705,
    "end_seconds": 342.135,
    "text": "never be as lonely as he was that day."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:42.705",
    "end": "00:05:43.030",
    "start_seconds": 342.705,
    "end_seconds": 343.03,
    "text": "Thank you."
  }
]
